<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Tourism half year loss.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Tourism half year loss.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     4.13 vs 7.13</p>
<p>    Net			   loss    11.03 vs 7.13 profit</p>
<p>    Distribution (cents per share)   3.5  vs 3.5</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	    loss    15.16 vs nil</p>
<p>Distribution is unfranked</p>
<p>Pay date March 27</p>
<p>Reg date March 12  </p>
<p>NOTE: Australian Tourism Group is an investor in mid-market tourist accomodation. The abnormal item relates to a write-down of Australian Tourism Group's 20 percent stake in Reef Casino Trust from A$21.4 million to A$6.25 million, in line with the fall in the trust's unit price.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
